--- !u!114 &647547434
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 647547429}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a3abd3eefe5ad3149affb0770a21e692, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DragonDialogue
  player: {fileID: 0}
  speakerName: Ember
  talkDistance: 3.5
  lines:
  - Whoa, easy! I'm Ember. I'm not going to chase you.
  - Sorry about my brothers back there. They see one running carrot and forget all
    their manners.
  - Let me make it up to you. Push that loose rock aside. There's a key behind it
    that opens the gate.
  - Watch the spinning barrier. Wait for an opening, then dash through with Shift.
  - Three gems can buy you one life. Press B when you're running low. They won't
    be spent if your lives are full.
  - Good luck, little carrot. If you see my brothers again, tell them Ember said
    to behave.
